  "$comment": "The one source for aifn-js's module tree (.scratch/aifn/module-tree.md). Core (package aifn): families in tiers, each with modules in local tiers and optional shared files at the family root; a module imports lower families, lower-tier modules of its own family, and its family's shared files. Applications (package aifn-applied): areas with nested groups and modules; a group's shared files serve its children; siblings share only through the parent; areas import others only down dependsOn. status \"gap\" marks a planned node with no code. aliases are the old flat paths, kept as re-export barrels only during phase 1 step 1. topics are taxonomy paths (content/taxonomy.yaml). Read by scripts/aifn-layers.ts (the lint and the README tables), the tests and the lab sidebar.",
